      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Openshaw",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Gorton Works, opened in 1848, built more than 900 locomotives before closing in 1963; the site is now New Smithfield Wholesale Market.",
